        "cached_at": 1778663186
      },
      {
        "id": 5374,
        "name": "Dark Wizard",
        "summary": "These are epic times for the people of Cheshire. The kingdom of Quentin is the last stronghold in all of Cheshire against the forces of darkness. But Quentin's king has been killed in battle. Cheshire desperately needs a successor to come forward and lead the warriors of light against the forces of darkness and, eventually, against the Dark Wizard himself. If you fail, darkness will rule Cheshire - forever!",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5wfs.jpg",
        "release_date": 753062400,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Role-playing (RPG),Strategy,Tactical",
        "platform_ids": "78",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/dark-wizard",
        "cached_at": 1778663186
      },
      {
        "id": 5383,
        "name": "Eternal Champions: Challenge from the Dark Side",
        "summary": "From various time periods of past, present and future, nine fighters killed in an unjust manner find themselves given a second chance for life. An alien being, known only as the Eternal Champion, brings back the fighters into a competition for one reason: to find one among them worthy of being resurrected, giving them a chance to avert their death and tip the balance between good and evil.\n\nThe fighters range from different eras of Earth's History: Larcen, the cat burglar. Jetta, the circus acrobat. Blade, the futuristic bounty hunter. Midknight, the vampiric bio-chemist. Rax, the cyborg. Shadow, the corporate assassin. Slash, the neanderthal. Trident, a Atlantean warrior. And Xavier, a warlock and alchemist.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4l1x.jpg",
        "release_date": 791942400,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Fighting",
        "platform_ids": "78",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/eternal-champions-challenge-from-the-dark-side",
        "cached_at": 1778663186
      },
      {
        "id": 5388,
        "name": "Formula One World Championship: Beyond the Limit",
        "summary": "Beyond the Limit is a racing sim based on Formula One circa 1993. It features real-life cars, tracks, and drivers from the world of F1.\n\nThe graphics in Beyond the Limit are created from scaled and rotated sprites that create a 3D effect. It also features a lot of full-screen video clips taken from Fuji TV's coverage of actual races.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2etj.jpg",
        "release_date": 767059200,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Racing",
        "platform_ids": "78",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/formula-one-world-championship-beyond-the-limit",
        "cached_at": 1778663186
      },
      {
        "id": 5402,
        "name": "Mansion of Hidden Souls",
        "summary": "Mansion of Hidden Souls is an adventure game created entirely with full-motion video. It takes place in a pre-rendered mansion that the player explores from a first-person perspective. As they wander from room to room, the action unfolds via video sequences.\n\nThe player takes on the role of Jonathan, a boy whose sister has wandered into the spooky mansion. When she entered the mansion, she disappeared! What's more, the mansion is full of talking butterflies. The player must search the whole mansion to unlock its secrets and find Jonathan's sister.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6dir.jpg",
        "release_date": 755481600,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Adventure",
        "platform_ids": "78",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/mansion-of-hidden-souls",
        "cached_at": 1778663186
      },
      {
        "id": 5420,
        "name": "Power Factory Featuring C+C Music Factory",
        "summary": "The first of Digital Pictures' \"Make My Video\" line has you \"editing\" three of C + C Music Factory's most famous songs - \"Gonna Make You Sweat,\" \"Things That Make You Go Hmm...\" and \"Here We Go Let's Rock & Roll.\"\n\nThe plot puts you inside the music factory of the game's name, where two linemen sweat and toil under the oppressive thumb of a wheelchair-bound corporate executive. Video discs literally roll down an assembly line while C + C record their sounds behind three closed doors. You are asked to help out in editing these videos, appease the corporate masters, and lift the burden from everyone.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5djx.jpg",
        "release_date": 725760000,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Music",
        "platform_ids": "78",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/power-factory-featuring-c-c-music-factory",
        "cached_at": 1778663186
      },
      {
        "id": 5424,
        "name": "Prize Fighter",
        "summary": "Prize Fighter is a FMV boxing game which puts the player in the body of a boxer known as \"The Kid\" and must face off against four opponents: Honeyboy Fernandez, Mega Joe Falco, Rex Hawkins, and, the ultimate challenge, Nuke \"The Duke\" Johnson, over the course of two CDs.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/iyxwvozz3b4g4k4zda3y.jpg",
        "release_date": 757296000,
        "rating": null,
